.TH GROUPOFFICE-MCP-SERVER 1 "September 2026" "mcp-server-groupoffice" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
groupoffice-mcp-server \- MCP server for GroupOffice groupware integration
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B groupoffice-mcp-server
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B groupoffice-mcp-server
is a Model Context Protocol (MCP) server for
.UR https://www.group-office.com/
GroupOffice
.UE
groupware, talking to its JMAP-style batch/RPC API.
It communicates over stdio using the MCP protocol and is intended to be
launched by an MCP client (e.g. Claude Code, Claude Desktop, mcprack, or
any other MCP-compatible agent runtime), not run interactively.
.PP
It is built on
.BR fastmcp .
.SH TOOL CATEGORIES
.TP
.B Contacts & Address Books
Search, read, create, update, delete.
.TP
.B Calendars & Events
Search, read, create, update, delete.
.TP
.B Tasks & Task Lists
Search, read, create, update, delete.
.TP
.B Notes
Search, read, create, update, delete.
.TP
.B Projects
(Projects v3 module, optional) Search, read, create, update, delete.
.TP
.B Comments
Search, read, create, update, delete.
.TP
.B History
Read-only audit log search.
.TP
.B Users & Groups
Read-only; administration is out of scope by design.
.TP
.B File attachments
Upload/download as GroupOffice blobs.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B GROUPOFFICE_URL
Base URL of the GroupOffice instance (required).
.TP
.B GROUPOFFICE_API_TOKEN
API bearer token, generated under System Settings -> API Keys (required).
.TP
.B GROUPOFFICE_VERIFY_SSL
Verify TLS certificates (default: true).
.TP
.B GROUPOFFICE_TIMEOUT
Request timeout in seconds (default: 30).
.TP
.B GROUPOFFICE_MAX_RETRIES
Connection-level retries for transient network errors (default: 3).
.TP
.B GROUPOFFICE_DEBUG
Enable debug logging (default: false).
.TP
.B GROUPOFFICE_READONLY
.B true
(default) rejects all mutating tools (create/update/delete/upload) before
any API call;
.B false
allows writes.
